---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="acquisition" class="bg-ink-950 text-ink-50">
  <div class="border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="container-narrow py-14 sm:py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
        <p class="mb-4 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-gold-400">Offered for acquisition</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl">ABQWax<span class="italic text-gold-300">.ing</span></h2>
        <p class="mt-5 font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gold-300 sm:text-6xl">$250,000</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-100/70">USD · Serious inquiries only</p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-100/80 sm:text-base">
          City, category, and the service verb in one hostname. A brand asset for an Albuquerque waxing studio, multi-location operator, or beauty group entering New Mexico.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="mailto:sales@desertrich.com?subject=Domain%20Inquiry%3A%20ABQWax.ing%20%E2%80%94%20%24250%2C000" class="btn-primary">
            sales@desertrich.com
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-xs text-ink-100/50">Confidential. Response within 1–2 business days.</p>
        <div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-xl space-y-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-left text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-100/55">
          <p><span class="font-medium text-ink-100/75">Delivery:</span> Digital domain transfer to the buyer’s registrar account. No physical shipping. Transfer typically completes within 0–5 business days after cleared payment and signed agreement. Transfer fee: $0.</p>
          <p><span class="font-medium text-ink-100/75">Returns:</span> All domain sales are final. Returns are not permitted once the transfer is initiated or completed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-narrow py-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-lg text-white">ABQWax.ing</p>
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widestx text-ink-100/50">Informational platform</p>
      </div>
      <nav class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-2 text-sm sm:grid-cols-3" aria-label="Footer navigation">
        <a href="/albuquerque-waxing/" class="text-ink-100/70 hover:text-gold-300">Albuquerque Waxing</a>
        <a href="/brazilian-wax-albuquerque/" class="text-ink-100/70 hover:text-gold-300">Brazilian Wax Albuquerque</a>
        <a href="/abq-waxing/" class="text-ink-100/70 hover:text-gold-300">ABQ Waxing</a>
        <a href="/hard-wax-albuquerque/" class="text-ink-100/70 hover:text-gold-300">Hard Wax Albuquerque</a>
        <a href="/insights/" class="text-ink-100/70 hover:text-gold-300">Waxing Insights</a>
        <a href="/#value" class="text-ink-100/70 hover:text-gold-300">Why It Is Rare</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-md text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-100/50">
      ABQWax.ing is offered for sale at $250,000 USD; serious inquiries to
      <a href="mailto:sales@desertrich.com" class="underline decoration-ink-100/30 underline-offset-2 hover:text-gold-300">sales@desertrich.com</a>.
      This site is an informational showcase for the domain — it does not offer salon services or guarantee outcomes.
      Statistics and market references are based on publicly available information as of the date shown.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-xs text-ink-100/40 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {currentYear} ABQWax.ing. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Astro · Cloudflare Workers Static Assets · Stream</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
